@startuml test_end_to_end_integration
participant "Legacy Sensor" as LS
participant "Edge Gateway" as EG
participant "Cloud Service" as CS

note over EG, CS: Phase 1: Gateway-Cloud Handshake
EG <-> CS: Negotiate Session & Derive Keys

note over LS, CS: Phase 2: End-to-End Data Transfer
LS -> LS: Generate Data
LS -> LS: Encrypt Data (Legacy AES)
LS -> EG: Transmit Encrypted Data

EG -> EG: Decrypt Data (Legacy AES)
EG -> EG: Re-Encrypt Data (Session AES)
EG -> CS: Forward Re-Encrypted Data

CS -> CS: Decrypt & Process Data (Session AES)

note over LS, CS: Assertion: Final Cloud Data == Original Sensor Data
@enduml
